				<h2>Chicago Pneumatic RCP-C1330G with Honda GX390 Engine</h2>
				<p>The RCP-C1330G gasoline truck mount air compressor utilizes a 13HP GX390 Honda engine. The RCP-C1330G is a two stage 175psi compressor which displaces 23cfm and features a constant run unloader valve for continuous operation. The Honda engine includes a pull and electric start motor for easy operation. The compressor has a fully cast-iron two stage pump for increased life and reliability. This gasoline truck mount compressor is meant to be operated in remote locations where reliable compressed air is required.</p>
