					<li>Continuous duty operation</li>
					<li>Fully Enclosed Belt Guard</li>
					<li>ASME/CRN Tank and Safety Valves</li>
					<li>Engine oil monitor</li>
					<li>Tank Mounted on ASME rated 30 gallon Receiver Tank</li>
